<title>UK: TESCO NAMES HIGGINSON FINANCE DIRECTOR.</title>
<headline>TESCO NAMES HIGGINSON FINANCE DIRECTOR.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>British supermarket chain Tesco Plc said on Thursday it had named Andrew Higginson group finance director.</p>
<p>Higginson, previously at British fashion chain Burton Group Plc, will succeed David Reid in November.</p>
<p>Reid, as deputy chairman, will be responsible for corporate strategy, operations in Europe and Ireland, distribution and information technology, Tesco said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
